<section id="what-is-eudr" style="background: #F2F4F7; padding: 96px 0">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #006386">EUDR explained</div>
<h2 style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em">What is the EUDR?</h2>
<p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #003143">The <strong>EU Deforestation Regulation (EUDR)</strong>, Regulation (EU) 2023/1115, is a European Union law that stops products linked to deforestation from being sold in the EU. It entered into force on 29 June 2023.</p>
<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467">Any company that places coffee or cocoa on the EU market must prove three things for every shipment: it is deforestation-free, it was produced legally, and it can be traced back to the exact plot of land where it was grown. Without that proof, the product cannot clear EU customs.</p>
<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467">Companies that break the rules face fines of up to at least 4% of their annual EU turnover, confiscation of goods and temporary exclusion from public contracts. That is why EU buyers are now pushing the data requirement upstream, to Indonesian exporters, cooperatives and farmers.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">Seven commodities are covered</h3>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px">
<span style="background: #FDB022; color: #003143; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Coffee</span>
<span style="background: #FDB022; color: #003143; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Cocoa</span>
<span style="background: #F2F4F7; color: #003143; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Oil palm</span>
<span style="background: #F2F4F7; color: #003143; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Rubber</span>
<span style="background: #F2F4F7; color: #003143; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Wood</span>
<span style="background: #F2F4F7; color: #003143; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Soya</span>
<span style="background: #F2F4F7; color: #003143; font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Cattle</span>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467; margin-top: 12px">Products made from them are covered too: roasted coffee, cocoa paste, butter, powder and chocolate.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">Key dates</h3>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin-top: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EAECF0"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #475467; min-width: 108px">29 Jun 2023</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Regulation enters into force</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EAECF0"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #006386; min-width: 108px">30 Dec 2026</span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Applies to large &amp; medium companies</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EAECF0"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #475467; min-width: 108px">30 Jun 2027</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Applies to micro &amp; small companies</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 10px 0"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #475467; min-width: 108px">30 Dec 2027</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Soluble (instant) coffee added</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="background: #003143; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">What it means for Indonesia</h3>
<p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C4D3DE; margin-top: 8px">The EU classifies Indonesia as <strong style="color: #FDB022">standard risk</strong>. Every shipment needs full due diligence, and there is no simplified route.</p>
</div>
