<div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #006386">What the EUDR asks of you</div>
<h2 style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin-top: 14px">No proof, no customs clearance. Every lot must pass three tests.</h2>
<p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 18px">The European Commission confirmed in May 2026 that there will be no further delay.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 44px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-top: 4px solid #006386; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#006386" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22V12"></path><path d="M12 12C12 7 8 4 4 4c0 5 3 8 8 8z"></path><path d="M12 14c0-4 3-7 8-7 0 4-3 7-8 7z"></path></svg>
<h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700">1. Deforestation-free</h3>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467">The coffee or cocoa must come from land that was not deforested or degraded after 31 December 2020.</p>
