<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-top: 4px solid #006386; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#006386" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9z"></path><path d="M14 3v6h6"></path><path d="M9 14l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
<h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700">2. Legally produced</h3>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467">Grown in line with Indonesian law: land tenure and land-use rights, environmental rules, labour and tax obligations, with documents such as SHM land certificates or STDB registrations to show it.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-top: 4px solid #006386; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#006386" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
<h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700">3. Traceable to the plot</h3>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467">A due diligence statement in the EU information system with the geolocation of every plot: a GPS point for plots up to 4 ha, a polygon for larger ones.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin-top: 28px; background: #F2F4F7; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 26px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 32px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">
<div style="flex: 1 1 320px"><strong>Who files?</strong> The company that first places the product on the EU market files the statement in the EU's TRACES information system. Under the December 2025 amendment, downstream companies pass on its reference number instead of filing their own.</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 320px"><strong>Why it lands on you:</strong> your EU buyer can only file if you hand over plot data, legality evidence and lot links. Suppliers who can't provide them risk losing EU contracts.</div>
