<div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #006386">Coffee</div>
<h2 style="font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin-top: 14px">EUDR for Indonesian coffee: from Lampung robusta to Gayo arabica</h2>
<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 16px">Indonesian coffee is grown mostly by smallholders on small plots, often bordering protected forest in Sumatra, and passes through several collectors before export. Blending lots from hundreds of farms is normal. Under EUDR, every plot in the blend must be known.</p>
<img src={coffeeHarvest.src} alt="A smallholder harvesting coffee cherries from a coffee tree" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 300px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: 28px">
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px">
