<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">The cocoa risk points we fix</h3>
<ul style="margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #003143">
<li>Agroforestry gardens that look like forest on satellite images</li>
<li>Wet beans pooled by village traders before fermentation</li>
<li>Processing into paste, butter and powder that breaks the link to origin</li>
<li>Cooperative member lists with no plot locations</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="background: #006386; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px">
<h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF">What PasarMIKRO delivers</h3>
