<li>Member and plot registry for cooperatives and traders</li>
<li>Field verification to tell established agroforestry from new clearing</li>
<li>Batch records from wet bean through fermentation to export lot</li>
<li>Mass-balance and lot reports that keep plot links through processing</li>
</ul>
