<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: #003143; background: #FDB022; border-radius: 999px; width: 32px; height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none">3</div><div><div style="font-weight: 700">Free setup, start mapping</div><div style="font-size: 14px; color: #475467">Your team is live on PasarMIKRO.</div></div></div>
